      "message": "Thanks for the detailed reply. The context on the earlier thread and the PDI change is really helpful, and no apology needed at all; the feedback was right for that revision.\n\nAgreed the whitelist is the better shape, so I\u0027ve implemented it that way as a separate commit at the bottom of the series: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/92864.\n\nI kept FlowMeter and NVMe in the list so nothing regresses as you say, hsbp-manager depends on Item.NVMe, so I\u0027ve left that alone.\n\nHi @patrick@stwcx.xyz, ps16: dropped Inventory.Item.Platform from the commit message example.",
